[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11581.349, "timestamp": "03:13:01", "text": "这是我买的东西，还有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11584.71, "timestamp": "03:13:04", "text": "它是膜的成员，两者都是膜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11587.75, "timestamp": "03:13:07", "text": "键盘，这样就不会有呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11592.07, "timestamp": "03:13:12", "text": "哈萨克哈萨克噪音。于是我就去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11593.59, "timestamp": "03:13:13", "text": "剃刀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11599.67, "timestamp": "03:13:19", "text": "是的，我选择了这个和键盘。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11602.95, "timestamp": "03:13:22", "text": "这是60%薄膜键盘。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11606.07, "timestamp": "03:13:26", "text": "我真的很喜欢60%键盘，因为它……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11609.11, "timestamp": "03:13:29", "text": "面积虽小，空间却很大。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11612.389, "timestamp": "03:13:32", "text": "无线连接也如你所见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11614.87, "timestamp": "03:13:34", "text": "你给它充电。充一两次电。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11618.63, "timestamp": "03:13:38", "text": "就是这样。很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11620.63, "timestamp": "03:13:40", "text": "这就像打字机键盘一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11623.429, "timestamp": "03:13:43", "text": "这大概是1美元，你会得到一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11627.19, "timestamp": "03:13:47", "text": "鼠标也是免费的，而且也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11629.429, "timestamp": "03:13:49", "text": "无线"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11633.269, "timestamp": "03:13:53", "text": "再次强调，60% 的这种可能性也很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11637.75, "timestamp": "03:13:57", "text": "所以我就这么做了，而且我觉得"}]